<title>UK: SGA sets warrants on LucasVarity.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on LucasVarity.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued 30 million European-style capped call warrants, on LucasVarity Plc, lead manager Societe Generale Strauss Turnbull Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2.30 STG		  CAP	    2.80 STG</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.205 STG		 SPOT REF     2.25 STG</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	12.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	30.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE   SGEGBPO7</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
